# Chains of Mephistopheles: "except the first one they draw in each of their draw steps" - "a player's normal card draw on
# their turn is exempt from this effect. All other draws will be affected" (its ruling). Bot2's turn 2 draw and Bot1's
# turn 3 draw are each the first card of the player's draw step and are drawn as usual: no discard (Bot2 holds eight cards
# then, and both graveyards stay as they were). Still in its turn 3 draw step, Bot1 casts Ancestral Recall: those three
# draws are not the first of the step, and each is a discard and then a draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Chains of Mephistopheles
Ancestral Recall
Forest
Plains
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

